From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam <i@noc.cat>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 08:05:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 62/63] arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp-radxa-dragon-q8b: add
 stdout-path

The board DTS names uart17 as serial0 but has no /chosen node, so a bare
"earlycon" on the command line finds no console and prints nothing.

Point stdout-path at serial0, the 40-pin header UART the board firmware
also uses, as the other SC8280XP boards do.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-radxa-dragon-q8b.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-radxa-dragon-q8b.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-radxa-dragon-q8b.dts
index 35c0a62..b7aa46f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-radxa-dragon-q8b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-radxa-dragon-q8b.dts
@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@
 		serial1 = &uart2;
 	};
 
+	chosen {
+		stdout-path = "serial0:115200n8";
+	};
+
 	wcd938x: audio-codec {
 		compatible = "qcom,wcd9385-codec";
 
